	<tr align=left>
			<td class="MainB"><b>No Grab Bag; and In Unrelated News</b><!--strTitle-->
			- 2002-06-14 20:30:13</td> <!--'strDate-->
	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			Sorry, folks, there won't be a grab bag tonight. We'll be back on track next week. 

<p> In other news, we are beginning phase three of Mordred's beta. This is going to be the closest thing to an open beta we've done yet. It's not truly open, as we intend to choose all players from the applicant pool. Guilds representing more than 2000 players received an email about five minutes ago, and will be added on Monday. We will keep adding people until we're ready to go live. Down the homestretch!<!--strDesc-->
			<a class="baseC" href="http://www.camelotherald.com/more/373.php">Read more...</a>
			<p></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left>
			<td class="MainB"><b>1.51E</b><!--strTitle-->
			- 2002-06-14 15:33:49</td> <!--'strDate-->
	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			Well, we don't call Pendragon the "test" server for nothing. The testing has resulted in some changes to that spell list we posted the other day:<!--strDesc-->
			<a class="baseC" href="http://www.camelotherald.com/more/372.php">Read more...</a>
			<p></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left>
			<td class="MainB"><b>1.51D Coming to Pendragon</b><!--strTitle-->
			- 2002-06-12 17:50:51</td> <!--'strDate-->
	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			A whole bunch of changes, including a LOT of spell tweakage. As with version A, we'd like to thank the community for all the thoughtful feedback that led directly to these changes. Good thing we've got some Pendragon copies in game now, eh?

<p>Speaking of copies, there are still a few thousand copies yet to be made, so hang in there. If you're continuing to get an error message, please be sure you spelled the name of the desired character correctly - a significant number of errors seem to be of the spelling variety. Also, the response has been significant - enough so that we're going to cap the number of copies we allow for this round at 10,000 users. More than that and y'all are liable to crash Pendragon. We will of course allow more copies if the population numbers require it in the future.<!--strDesc-->
			<a class="baseC" href="http://www.camelotherald.com/more/371.php">Read more...</a>
			<p></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left>
			<td class="MainB"><b>Last Night's Excitement</b><!--strTitle-->
			- 2002-06-12 11:54:52</td> <!--'strDate-->
	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			Just FYI - last night, there was a problem with a router in the building where we keep our servers for the game. Data was basically in an endless loop between one router and another, which meant everyone (on all servers) trying to play around midnight EST got dumped. It wasn't fun for any of us who were innocently trying to kill people, and we got it attended to as fast as we were able.<!--strDesc-->
			<a class="baseC" href="http://www.camelotherald.com/more/370.php">Read more...</a>
			<p></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left>
			<td class="MainB"><b>The Little Copier That Could</b><!--strTitle-->
			- 2002-06-12 09:46:47</td> <!--'strDate-->
	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			"I THINK I can I THINK I can I THINK I can..."<p>Due to the network problems we suffered last night around midnight EST the character copier stopped running around that time. (If you can't connect to the game, normally we can't either!)<p>It's been restarted and is working through the 2,500 remaining in the queue. If you haven't been copied yet, it should happen sometime today.<p>We've also changed the error message you get via email if you've already copied a character to Pendragon or Mordred, to let you know if you have a character waiting to be copied.<p>Thanks for your patience, and your enthusiasm.<!--strDesc-->
			<a class="baseC" href="http://www.camelotherald.com/more/369.php">Read more...</a>
			<p></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left>
			<td class="MainB"><b>Pendragon/Mordred Copier Update</b><!--strTitle-->
			- 2002-06-11 21:04:31</td> <!--'strDate-->
	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			When Sanya said that the new /charcopy command was popular, she wasn't kidding. We've already worked through over 1,500 copies, and right now have a little over 1,100 to go. We're working through about 300 an hour, so if you just requested a copy, you've got at least a 3 hour wait.<p>If your /charcopy hasn't kicked in by tomorrow morning, or you have any other problem with the copy process, please <a href="mailto:scottj@mythicentertainment.com">let me know</a>. Thanks!<!--strDesc-->
			<a class="baseC" href="http://www.camelotherald.com/more/368.php">Read more...</a>
			<p></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left>
			<td class="MainB"><b>Pendragon Copier Sure Is Popular</b><!--strTitle-->
			- 2002-06-11 18:03:29</td> <!--'strDate-->
	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			Hey, everyone. People are eager to help us test things, and for that we are truly grateful and appreciative. But please, be patient. If you'll reread the directions, the copy may occur at any point between "immediately" and "twelve hours from now." Please do not contact us if you haven't yet exceeded a twelve hour wait. Also, if you do run into unexpected problems you cannot solve by following the posted directions, please email Scott at scottj@mythicentertainment.com - don't appeal our CSRs, this isn't a problem they can solve.<!--strDesc-->
			<a class="baseC" href="http://www.camelotherald.com/more/367.php">Read more...</a>
			<p></td>
	</tr>
	
